1
00:01:36,710 --> 00:01:38,840
[The Lament of Autumn]

2
00:01:39,350 --> 00:01:41,800
[Episode 7]

3
00:01:44,450 --> 00:01:46,920
Miss Ye, it seems
you have two different sides to you

4
00:01:46,920 --> 00:01:48,380
when dealing with people.

5
00:01:50,590 --> 00:01:52,920
When you're in the company of a gentleman,

6
00:01:53,310 --> 00:01:55,970
there's no need
to worry about your reputation.

7
00:01:56,229 --> 00:01:57,039
Ye Pingjun.

8
00:01:57,789 --> 00:01:58,620
Don't think that just because
Fifth Young Master

9
00:01:58,620 --> 00:01:59,620
lets you off the hook time and again,

10
00:01:59,620 --> 00:02:01,220
you can act so outrageously.

11
00:02:02,590 --> 00:02:04,070
I know my place.

12
00:02:04,510 --> 00:02:05,780
I don't deserve

13
00:02:06,090 --> 00:02:07,890
Fifth Young Master's kindness.

14
00:02:30,630 --> 00:02:32,280
I saved it for Changxuan.

15
00:02:32,410 --> 00:02:33,579
Just a little.

16
00:02:33,690 --> 00:02:35,090
You've already had some.

17
00:02:38,900 --> 00:02:39,740
You're back?

18
00:02:40,530 --> 00:02:40,960
Mom.

19
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:42,800
You must be tired.

20
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:44,470
Sit.

21
00:02:45,250 --> 00:02:47,400
We have freshly made walnut cakes today.

22
00:02:47,400 --> 00:02:48,800
And there's chicken soup

23
00:02:48,910 --> 00:02:50,360
warming on the stove for you.

24
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:51,380
Bring him a bowl.

25
00:02:51,400 --> 00:02:52,590
-No need.
-Alright.

26
00:02:53,130 --> 00:02:54,530
Don't tire yourself out.

27
00:02:55,020 --> 00:02:57,020
I'll just go back to my room and rest.

28
00:02:57,970 --> 00:02:58,870
Changxuan.

29
00:02:59,590 --> 00:03:00,450
What is it, Mom?

30
00:03:11,710 --> 00:03:13,150
Don't work too hard.

31
00:03:14,900 --> 00:03:15,620
I know.

32
00:03:16,170 --> 00:03:16,950
You too.

33
00:03:33,020 --> 00:03:34,020
Brother-in-law.

34
00:03:41,210 --> 00:03:42,590
Time flies.

35
00:03:42,690 --> 00:03:43,550
Look at you now,

36
00:03:43,620 --> 00:03:45,370
all grown up
and able to stand on your own.

37
00:03:45,370 --> 00:03:47,000
You're no longer

38
00:03:47,250 --> 00:03:48,650
the teenager I remember.

39
00:03:49,840 --> 00:03:51,040
If it weren't for you,

40
00:03:51,360 --> 00:03:52,240
I'd have died

41
00:03:52,270 --> 00:03:53,670
in those ruins years ago.

42
00:03:53,900 --> 00:03:55,760
I won't forget what you did for me.

43
00:03:56,030 --> 00:03:57,840
You don't have to thank me.

44
00:03:58,090 --> 00:03:59,680
There's no need
to stand on ceremony between us.

45
00:03:59,680 --> 00:04:00,190
Come on.

46
00:04:07,580 --> 00:04:08,780
But there's one thing

47
00:04:09,120 --> 00:04:10,250
I must remind you of.

48
00:04:11,360 --> 00:04:12,630
Father is Father.

49
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:13,900
No matter what,

50
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:16,000
you mustn't disrespect him.

51
00:04:16,800 --> 00:04:17,740
I don't know

52
00:04:18,190 --> 00:04:18,829
what you two

53
00:04:18,829 --> 00:04:20,430
were talking about that day,

54
00:04:20,680 --> 00:04:21,829
but Father looked

55
00:04:22,600 --> 00:04:24,130
very upset when he came out.

56
00:04:27,010 --> 00:04:28,270
You are father and son.

57
00:04:28,690 --> 00:04:29,950
Whatever the issue is,

58
00:04:30,140 --> 00:04:32,340
you can discuss it behind closed doors.

59
00:04:34,630 --> 00:04:35,630
Brother-in-law,

60
00:04:36,270 --> 00:04:37,800
I understand what you mean.

61
00:04:39,740 --> 00:04:40,930
Military affairs

62
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:42,070
are complicated.

63
00:04:42,510 --> 00:04:44,760
Even just reforming the Ninth Army

64
00:04:45,130 --> 00:04:46,120
is not easy.

65
00:04:47,070 --> 00:04:48,200
You must be careful.

66
00:04:49,630 --> 00:04:52,159
Thank you for the reminder,
Brother-in-law.

67
00:04:53,430 --> 00:04:54,310
No matter what,

68
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:56,800
I will always stand by your side.

69
00:05:04,620 --> 00:05:05,830
Say something.

70
00:05:07,570 --> 00:05:08,430
Every one of you

71
00:05:08,500 --> 00:05:10,100
has been scared by Changxuan

72
00:05:10,270 --> 00:05:11,810
and become mute.

73
00:05:13,070 --> 00:05:14,530
This Fifth Young Master Yu

74
00:05:14,830 --> 00:05:16,600
has used the strict enforcement
of military discipline

75
00:05:16,600 --> 00:05:18,120
as a pretext to thoroughly investigate

76
00:05:18,120 --> 00:05:19,250
all our businesses.

77
00:05:19,310 --> 00:05:21,540
Some have been shut down,
while others have been suspended.

78
00:05:21,540 --> 00:05:22,200
From now on,

79
00:05:22,750 --> 00:05:23,890
we won't have a day of peace.

80
00:05:23,890 --> 00:05:25,510
He has been planning for years,

81
00:05:25,510 --> 00:05:26,980
so it's watertight.

82
00:05:27,160 --> 00:05:28,190
As for how to deal with us,

83
00:05:28,190 --> 00:05:30,520
he's had it all figured out
for a long time.

84
00:05:30,950 --> 00:05:31,620
He's made such a big fuss

85
00:05:31,620 --> 00:05:33,100
these past few days

86
00:05:33,450 --> 00:05:35,070
without even giving us a heads-up.

87
00:05:35,070 --> 00:05:36,620
He clearly has no respect

88
00:05:36,620 --> 00:05:37,680
for us, his elders.

89
00:05:38,040 --> 00:05:38,770
Feng,

90
00:05:39,450 --> 00:05:40,380
don't get angry.

91
00:05:41,010 --> 00:05:43,250
Fifth Young Master
has gone a bit too far this time,

92
00:05:43,250 --> 00:05:46,250
but a new official
always makes a show of being strict.

93
00:05:46,390 --> 00:05:48,180
Since he's proposed
tightening up military discipline,

94
00:05:48,180 --> 00:05:49,659
we elders

95
00:05:49,659 --> 00:05:51,120
should support him.

96
00:05:54,070 --> 00:05:54,870
Gu,

97
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:57,450
your son is one of Changxuan's

98
00:05:57,450 --> 00:05:59,100
closest men.

99
00:05:59,310 --> 00:06:00,970
Of course you're not worried.

100
00:06:01,920 --> 00:06:02,810
I think he wants to get rid of

101
00:06:02,810 --> 00:06:03,570
all of us

102
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:05,330
and use his own men

103
00:06:05,330 --> 00:06:06,950
in the army.

104
00:06:08,690 --> 00:06:09,690
The capable rise,

105
00:06:10,180 --> 00:06:11,440
the incompetent fall,

106
00:06:11,500 --> 00:06:13,360
and the worthless are weeded out.

107
00:06:13,360 --> 00:06:14,830
There's nothing wrong with that.

108
00:06:14,830 --> 00:06:15,630
Scholar,

109
00:06:15,870 --> 00:06:17,310
stop being sarcastic.

110
00:06:18,750 --> 00:06:21,150
With Changxuan showing no mercy to anyone,

111
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:23,310
you've been investigated too, haven't you?

112
00:06:23,310 --> 00:06:24,420
I'm not afraid of an investigation.

113
00:06:24,420 --> 00:06:25,130
Alright.

114
00:06:25,800 --> 00:06:27,040
Everyone, calm down.

115
00:06:27,980 --> 00:06:29,980
Nothing can be built
without tearing down the old.

116
00:06:29,980 --> 00:06:31,370
Let's give Fifth Young Master some time

117
00:06:31,370 --> 00:06:32,480
to get the army in order.

118
00:06:32,480 --> 00:06:34,340
Once everything is back on track,

119
00:06:34,480 --> 00:06:35,310
I'm sure

120
00:06:36,390 --> 00:06:37,360
he'll show some respect

121
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:38,659
for us elders.

122
00:06:39,120 --> 00:06:40,250
None of you will lose

123
00:06:40,560 --> 00:06:41,690
even a fraction of your rank.

124
00:06:41,690 --> 00:06:43,020
Stop talking nonsense.

125
00:06:43,750 --> 00:06:46,130
Let me make one thing clear.

126
00:06:46,450 --> 00:06:48,180
As long as I, Feng Sanli, am around,

127
00:06:48,180 --> 00:06:49,370
he'll have to turn a blind eye

128
00:06:49,370 --> 00:06:52,100
when it comes to
enforcing military discipline.

129
00:06:52,570 --> 00:06:55,870
If he keeps both eyes wide open,

130
00:06:57,950 --> 00:06:58,750
he'll be

131
00:07:00,420 --> 00:07:03,720
making a huge mistake.

132
00:07:05,240 --> 00:07:10,010
[Sealed by Nanhuai Army Headquarters]

133
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:09,570
We were just putting on
our usual performances.

134
00:07:09,570 --> 00:07:10,660
What gives you the right to shut us down

135
00:07:10,660 --> 00:07:11,460
for no reason?

136
00:07:11,630 --> 00:07:13,360
It's Staff Officer Li's order.

137
00:07:13,570 --> 00:07:14,700
And who's above him?

138
00:07:15,250 --> 00:07:16,200
Fifth Young Master Yu!

139
00:07:16,200 --> 00:07:17,570
Either get lost now

140
00:07:18,120 --> 00:07:19,510
or go to the police station to talk!

141
00:07:19,510 --> 00:07:20,950
You are completely lawless!

142
00:07:20,950 --> 00:07:21,690
Give us an explanation!

143
00:07:21,690 --> 00:07:22,930
Why did you seal it?

144
00:07:23,250 --> 00:07:24,580
Give us an explanation!

145
00:07:25,660 --> 00:07:26,990
I've got the full story.

146
00:07:27,160 --> 00:07:28,190
Those people from the Chunfeng Troupe

147
00:07:28,190 --> 00:07:29,750
have been secretly preparing
a charity performance to drum up support.

148
00:07:29,750 --> 00:07:30,200
Their purpose

149
00:07:30,200 --> 00:07:32,330
is to keep the refugees in the suburbs.

150
00:07:32,330 --> 00:07:33,830
Here's the strange part.

151
00:07:34,070 --> 00:07:35,570
That place where the refugees
are temporarily staying,

152
00:07:35,570 --> 00:07:36,850
Qingshui Town or something,

153
00:07:36,850 --> 00:07:38,909
has suddenly become a hot commodity.

154
00:07:38,950 --> 00:07:40,250
I heard soldiers tried to drive them out

155
00:07:40,250 --> 00:07:41,560
over ten days ago.

156
00:07:43,190 --> 00:07:46,000
Looks like someone in the army
wants to get involved.

157
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:48,390
That piece of land is remote.

158
00:07:49,010 --> 00:07:50,670
What use could it possibly be?

159
00:07:51,070 --> 00:07:51,980
And how did it get involved

160
00:07:51,980 --> 00:07:53,580
with people in the military?

161
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:56,750
Find out who's after that land.

162
00:07:57,570 --> 00:07:58,159
Yes.

163
00:08:01,250 --> 00:08:02,580
There's one more thing.

164
00:08:02,890 --> 00:08:03,810
Tell me,

165
00:08:03,810 --> 00:08:04,950
did I do a good job?

166
00:08:05,870 --> 00:08:07,950
I've already had the troupe shut down.

167
00:08:07,950 --> 00:08:08,660
Starting today,

168
00:08:08,660 --> 00:08:09,930
you won't have to see

169
00:08:09,930 --> 00:08:11,600
that eyesore, Liang Wenbo, ever again.

170
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:12,860
Who told you to do that?

171
00:08:13,450 --> 00:08:13,910
Well...

172
00:08:15,070 --> 00:08:17,000
Wasn't I doing it for your own good?

173
00:08:17,070 --> 00:08:18,060
Besides...

174
00:08:18,060 --> 00:08:19,120
Miss, you can't go in!

175
00:08:19,120 --> 00:08:20,320
Miss, you can't go in!

176
00:08:20,430 --> 00:08:21,240
Let her in.

177
00:08:21,950 --> 00:08:23,150
What brings you here?

178
00:08:26,540 --> 00:08:27,690
Fifth Young Master Yu,

179
00:08:27,690 --> 00:08:29,560
did you order our troupe to be shut down?

180
00:08:29,560 --> 00:08:30,360
Ye Pingjun,

181
00:08:30,510 --> 00:08:32,510
don't come barging in here
making accusations.

182
00:08:32,510 --> 00:08:34,010
Fifth Young Master
knew nothing about this.

183
00:08:34,010 --> 00:08:35,340
-It was me...
-Li Boren.

184
00:08:36,440 --> 00:08:36,909
Out.

185
00:08:37,340 --> 00:08:40,530
-Come on, Fifth Young Master. You…
-I'm asking you to leave.

186
00:08:40,530 --> 00:08:42,120
I'm not even allowed to explain.

187
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:44,049
Let's go. You think you can listen?

188
00:08:58,820 --> 00:08:59,600
It was me.

189
00:09:01,390 --> 00:09:02,250
So what?

190
00:09:06,120 --> 00:09:06,980
I don't know what

191
00:09:06,980 --> 00:09:07,620
I've done this time

192
00:09:07,620 --> 00:09:09,240
to anger you, Fifth Young Master Yu.

193
00:09:09,240 --> 00:09:09,720
But if

194
00:09:09,720 --> 00:09:11,100
you really can't stand me,

195
00:09:11,100 --> 00:09:12,430
you can take it out on me.

196
00:09:12,500 --> 00:09:14,030
Why hurt the innocent?

197
00:09:18,910 --> 00:09:20,010
I heard you've been secretly

198
00:09:20,010 --> 00:09:21,870
preparing a benefit performance

199
00:09:22,150 --> 00:09:24,880
and lobbying the Charity Union
behind the scenes

200
00:09:24,940 --> 00:09:26,400
to take in those refugees.

201
00:09:32,370 --> 00:09:34,170
I'm not asking for your support,

202
00:09:34,790 --> 00:09:36,630
but please don't stand in our way.

203
00:09:36,630 --> 00:09:38,860
Those refugees are already homeless

204
00:09:38,860 --> 00:09:40,390
and lack food and clothing.

205
00:09:40,390 --> 00:09:41,840
If they're driven out,

206
00:09:42,410 --> 00:09:43,720
their chances of survival

207
00:09:43,720 --> 00:09:44,920
will be even slimmer.

208
00:09:45,860 --> 00:09:47,370
War always comes at a cost.

209
00:09:49,720 --> 00:09:51,580
I have no obligation to help them.

210
00:09:57,370 --> 00:09:58,970
I understand your position.

211
00:10:01,480 --> 00:10:02,630
I also heard

212
00:10:03,370 --> 00:10:05,440
that you just took over the Ninth Army.

213
00:10:05,440 --> 00:10:07,010
If you can give
those refugees proper shelter

214
00:10:07,010 --> 00:10:08,550
in the name of benevolence,

215
00:10:08,890 --> 00:10:11,290
it'll do wonders for your reputation

216
00:10:11,290 --> 00:10:12,630
and the Ninth Army's.

217
00:10:12,870 --> 00:10:14,030
It's a win-win.

218
00:10:25,010 --> 00:10:26,530
You think you know me well?

219
00:10:28,720 --> 00:10:29,740
I wouldn't presume to say

220
00:10:29,740 --> 00:10:30,600
that I do.

221
00:10:31,360 --> 00:10:32,160
I'm simply...

222
00:10:33,510 --> 00:10:35,200
asking you to show some mercy.

223
00:10:36,650 --> 00:10:37,530
How those outsiders

224
00:10:37,530 --> 00:10:38,980
are living

225
00:10:40,650 --> 00:10:41,850
is none of my concern.

226
00:10:45,290 --> 00:10:46,290
You're right.

227
00:10:47,620 --> 00:10:49,080
They're not from Nanhuai,

228
00:10:49,770 --> 00:10:51,150
but they are Chinese.

229
00:10:51,820 --> 00:10:53,150
We're all compatriots.

230
00:10:53,650 --> 00:10:54,410
When our own people

231
00:10:54,410 --> 00:10:56,290
are enduring such inhumane treatment,

232
00:10:56,290 --> 00:10:57,860
shouldn't we stand together

233
00:10:57,860 --> 00:11:00,060
and offer them at least a little warmth?

234
00:11:00,100 --> 00:11:00,980
Chinese people should help

235
00:11:00,980 --> 00:11:02,240
their fellow Chinese.

236
00:11:05,320 --> 00:11:06,050
Are you done?

237
00:11:09,120 --> 00:11:10,780
If you're done, you can leave.

238
00:11:14,620 --> 00:11:15,870
I should've known

239
00:11:17,340 --> 00:11:19,140
that coming here to tell you this

240
00:11:19,910 --> 00:11:21,370
would be a waste of breath.

241
00:11:24,370 --> 00:11:25,010
Excuse me.

242
00:11:36,440 --> 00:11:39,500
[Yu Mansion]

243
00:11:41,530 --> 00:11:42,340
Tao.

244
00:11:43,220 --> 00:11:44,620
How long has it been

245
00:11:44,620 --> 00:11:46,420
since we sat together like this?

246
00:11:48,030 --> 00:11:49,150
But you're doing well.

247
00:11:49,150 --> 00:11:51,410
You haven't changed a bit over the years.

248
00:11:51,790 --> 00:11:53,720
I can't compare to you, Zhongquan.

249
00:11:54,050 --> 00:11:55,370
You have such a capable son

250
00:11:55,370 --> 00:11:56,230
to help you out.

251
00:11:57,860 --> 00:11:59,320
You flatter me, Uncle Tao.

252
00:11:59,530 --> 00:12:00,340
As for me,

253
00:12:00,480 --> 00:12:02,050
once I get my precious daughter
settled down,

254
00:12:02,050 --> 00:12:03,390
which is my greatest wish,

255
00:12:03,390 --> 00:12:05,740
I can retire in peace
and enjoy my old age.

256
00:12:07,050 --> 00:12:09,100
Dad, what are you talking about?

257
00:12:09,720 --> 00:12:10,550
Look at her.

258
00:12:13,860 --> 00:12:14,630
Ziyi.

259
00:12:15,010 --> 00:12:15,790
Auntie.

260
00:12:16,030 --> 00:12:17,290
I picked out this gift

261
00:12:17,490 --> 00:12:19,530
for you myself.

262
00:12:19,790 --> 00:12:20,840
Try it on.

263
00:12:21,120 --> 00:12:22,890
Auntie, this is too expensive.

264
00:12:22,890 --> 00:12:24,500
Don't be so polite with me.

265
00:12:24,620 --> 00:12:25,240
Put it on.

266
00:12:27,550 --> 00:12:28,500
Perfect.

267
00:12:29,170 --> 00:12:30,300
It looks beautiful.

268
00:12:31,340 --> 00:12:31,870
Sit down.

269
00:12:32,250 --> 00:12:33,050
So beautiful.

270
00:12:33,220 --> 00:12:34,280
Thank you, Auntie.

271
00:12:34,650 --> 00:12:35,840
You're welcome.

272
00:12:37,130 --> 00:12:38,220
I've spoiled Ziyi

273
00:12:38,340 --> 00:12:40,050
since she was a child.

274
00:12:40,550 --> 00:12:41,700
I'll have to ask you

275
00:12:41,790 --> 00:12:43,990
to teach her some manners in the future.

276
00:12:44,200 --> 00:12:46,460
Ziyi is so elegant and well-mannered.

277
00:12:46,500 --> 00:12:48,370
I can't love her enough.

278
00:12:48,370 --> 00:12:50,700
I'd love to treat her
like my own daughter.

279
00:12:53,100 --> 00:12:54,650
Changxuan and I

280
00:12:54,650 --> 00:12:55,980
discussed this before.

281
00:12:56,220 --> 00:12:57,550
After Ziyi graduates,

282
00:12:57,550 --> 00:12:59,390
we'll arrange for them to get engaged.

283
00:12:59,390 --> 00:13:02,460
What do you... think about it,

284
00:13:02,550 --> 00:13:04,030
Zhongquan?

285
00:13:05,630 --> 00:13:06,830
You have a say in this.

286
00:13:08,200 --> 00:13:09,770
It would be wonderful

287
00:13:10,390 --> 00:13:12,390
if these two kids could be together.

288
00:13:12,530 --> 00:13:14,220
Once the date is set,

289
00:13:14,250 --> 00:13:16,120
I'll handle everything.

290
00:13:16,550 --> 00:13:17,870
I have no objections.

291
00:13:19,440 --> 00:13:21,250
However, we still need to see

292
00:13:21,720 --> 00:13:24,290
what the kids think.

293
00:13:39,370 --> 00:13:41,480
We will follow our elders' arrangements.

294
00:13:41,480 --> 00:13:43,860
Great. Then it's settled.

295
00:13:43,860 --> 00:13:44,750
Good, good.

296
00:14:44,940 --> 00:14:45,940
You're right.

297
00:14:47,240 --> 00:14:48,750
They're not from Nanhuai,

298
00:14:49,480 --> 00:14:51,050
but they are Chinese.

299
00:14:52,630 --> 00:14:53,960
We're all compatriots.

300
00:14:54,700 --> 00:14:55,340
When our own people

301
00:14:55,340 --> 00:14:57,540
are enduring such inhumane treatment,

302
00:14:57,630 --> 00:14:59,340
shouldn't we stand together

303
00:14:59,340 --> 00:15:01,540
and offer them at least a little warmth?

304
00:15:01,550 --> 00:15:02,370
Chinese people should

305
00:15:02,370 --> 00:15:03,900
help their fellow Chinese.

306
00:15:05,320 --> 00:15:06,920
I don't ask for your support,

307
00:15:07,770 --> 00:15:09,740
but please don't stand in our way.

308
00:15:12,670 --> 00:15:13,630
Changxuan.

309
00:15:14,530 --> 00:15:15,730
What I want to build is

310
00:15:16,840 --> 00:15:18,510
a house for the common people.

311
00:15:19,620 --> 00:15:20,440
Why?

312
00:15:21,220 --> 00:15:23,940
Because it's a home.

313
00:15:34,840 --> 00:15:35,650
Thank you.

314
00:15:41,890 --> 00:15:42,720
Give me one.

315
00:15:42,860 --> 00:15:43,670
Give me one.

316
00:15:47,790 --> 00:15:48,840
Sorry, everyone.

317
00:15:49,340 --> 00:15:50,840
I couldn't convince Fifth Young Master Yu

318
00:15:50,840 --> 00:15:52,440
to lift the ban on the troupe.

319
00:15:53,630 --> 00:15:54,170
Pingjun.

320
00:15:54,750 --> 00:15:55,390
The military was against

321
00:15:55,390 --> 00:15:57,220
taking in refugees from the start.

322
00:15:57,220 --> 00:15:58,480
This is not your fault.

323
00:15:58,480 --> 00:15:59,740
Don't blame yourself.

324
00:15:59,940 --> 00:16:01,440
The performance this weekend

325
00:16:01,440 --> 00:16:02,100
is still on.

326
00:16:02,820 --> 00:16:04,240
I've asked a friend

327
00:16:04,750 --> 00:16:05,460
to find us

328
00:16:05,460 --> 00:16:06,410
another venue.

329
00:16:06,650 --> 00:16:08,050
It'll be in Qingliu Alley, right next

330
00:16:08,050 --> 00:16:09,180
to the refugee camp.

331
00:16:09,480 --> 00:16:11,220
And our costumes and props

332
00:16:11,480 --> 00:16:13,410
will be secretly transported out.

333
00:16:13,620 --> 00:16:14,750
Don't worry, Director Liang.

334
00:16:14,750 --> 00:16:15,750
We won't give up

335
00:16:15,750 --> 00:16:17,120
until the very last minute.

336
00:16:17,120 --> 00:16:18,720
That's right! We won't give up!

337
00:16:18,720 --> 00:16:19,860
That's right. Never give up.

338
00:16:19,860 --> 00:16:20,660
Never give up.

339
00:16:21,220 --> 00:16:22,500
Extra! Extra!

340
00:16:22,650 --> 00:16:25,150
Fifth Young Master Yu,
son of Commander-in-Chief Yu,

341
00:16:25,150 --> 00:16:26,360
is about to marry

342
00:16:26,360 --> 00:16:27,830
the second daughter

343
00:16:27,910 --> 00:16:29,340
of President Tao of Tonghui Bank!

344
00:16:28,170 --> 00:16:30,170
[Nanhuai Evening News]

345
00:16:29,860 --> 00:16:31,200
Extra! Extra!

346
00:16:31,840 --> 00:16:34,250
Fifth Young Master Yu,
son of Commander-in-Chief Yu,

347
00:16:32,540 --> 00:16:33,090
[Yu Changxuan, Son of
Commander-in-Chief Yu, Set to Wed]

348
00:16:33,110 --> 00:16:33,690
[Tao Ziyi, Second Daughter
of Tonghui Bank President Tao]

349
00:16:34,250 --> 00:16:35,510
is about to marry

350
00:16:35,510 --> 00:16:36,980
the second daughter

351
00:16:36,020 --> 00:16:36,680
[Yu Changxuan, Son of
Commander-in-Chief Yu, Set to Wed]

352
00:16:36,700 --> 00:16:37,580
[Tao Ziyi, Second Daughter
of Tonghui Bank President Tao]

353
00:16:37,220 --> 00:16:39,080
of President Tao of Tonghui Bank!

354
00:16:47,510 --> 00:16:48,890
What did I say?

355
00:16:49,250 --> 00:16:50,670
Wildflowers can never become

356
00:16:50,670 --> 00:16:52,130
peonies born into wealth.

357
00:16:52,720 --> 00:16:55,120
You ended up getting dumped, didn't you?

358
00:16:58,790 --> 00:16:59,640
Taochun,

359
00:16:59,790 --> 00:17:01,790
I'm going to help out in the kitchen.

360
00:17:02,150 --> 00:17:03,150
What are you afraid of?

361
00:17:03,150 --> 00:17:03,860
Taochun!

362
00:17:12,310 --> 00:17:13,099
Master Jin.

363
00:17:17,700 --> 00:17:18,630
Save your effort

364
00:17:19,400 --> 00:17:20,790
for the stage.

365
00:17:21,329 --> 00:17:23,000
Don't let me hear that again.

366
00:17:23,569 --> 00:17:25,160
Yes, Master Jin.

367
00:17:50,600 --> 00:17:51,960
[Yu Changxuan, Son of
Commander-in-Chief Yu, Set to Wed]

368
00:17:51,980 --> 00:17:53,450
[Tao Ziyi, Second Daughter
of Tonghui Bank President Tao]

369
00:17:56,240 --> 00:17:57,330
The maid said

370
00:17:58,580 --> 00:18:00,780
you haven't been sleeping well lately.

371
00:18:04,900 --> 00:18:05,740
I'm fine.

372
00:18:09,920 --> 00:18:11,310
Ever since that time,

373
00:18:14,850 --> 00:18:16,510
I've always had this problem.

374
00:18:22,400 --> 00:18:24,730
I had someone bring this back from abroad.

375
00:18:26,660 --> 00:18:28,430
It's the brand you used to take.

376
00:18:32,700 --> 00:18:34,230
The autumn wind is blowing.

377
00:18:34,440 --> 00:18:35,640
Put on more clothes.

378
00:18:36,810 --> 00:18:38,670
You need to take care of yourself.

379
00:18:45,110 --> 00:18:46,350
Thank you, Jin,

380
00:18:48,460 --> 00:18:49,920
for always thinking of me.

381
00:19:25,570 --> 00:19:26,440
Director Liang.

382
00:19:26,440 --> 00:19:28,160
These children with fevers and coughs

383
00:19:28,160 --> 00:19:29,200
can only be kept here

384
00:19:29,200 --> 00:19:30,590
so they can take their medicine on time.

385
00:19:30,590 --> 00:19:31,980
We can't just let them
keep running fevers.

386
00:19:31,980 --> 00:19:32,780
We still need to find a doctor.

387
00:19:32,780 --> 00:19:33,300
Yes.

388
00:19:33,360 --> 00:19:33,950
Thank you.

389
00:19:33,950 --> 00:19:35,010
-Here.
-Thank you.

390
00:19:45,770 --> 00:19:47,030
I have some candy here.

391
00:19:47,070 --> 00:19:48,510
It has loquat leaves in it,

392
00:19:48,510 --> 00:19:49,970
which can stop your cough.

393
00:19:50,590 --> 00:19:52,810
Miss, I don't want it.

394
00:19:52,810 --> 00:19:54,310
None of my friends

395
00:19:54,310 --> 00:19:56,310
survived.

396
00:19:56,310 --> 00:19:57,960
I'll end up the same way.

397
00:20:00,510 --> 00:20:01,380
No, you won't.

398
00:20:01,750 --> 00:20:03,680
We have medicine and doctors here.

399
00:20:04,000 --> 00:20:05,800
You will definitely get better.

400
00:20:06,290 --> 00:20:07,200
Miss.

401
00:20:07,460 --> 00:20:08,790
Children without a home

402
00:20:08,790 --> 00:20:11,200
and without parents

403
00:20:11,200 --> 00:20:13,350
won't make it to adulthood.

404
00:20:30,480 --> 00:20:31,290
What's going on?

405
00:20:31,290 --> 00:20:32,000
Officers,

406
00:20:32,070 --> 00:20:33,130
what are you doing?

407
00:20:34,460 --> 00:20:35,770
Listen up, everyone!

408
00:20:36,330 --> 00:20:37,460
We received a report

409
00:20:37,490 --> 00:20:39,550
that someone here has tuberculosis.

410
00:20:39,550 --> 00:20:41,140
You have one day

411
00:20:41,500 --> 00:20:43,250
to pack your things

412
00:20:43,270 --> 00:20:44,330
and get out of here.

413
00:20:44,330 --> 00:20:45,570
No one is allowed to stay!

414
00:20:45,570 --> 00:20:46,640
Did you hear me?

415
00:20:47,510 --> 00:20:48,790
The Charity Union will decide

416
00:20:48,790 --> 00:20:49,700
whether these refugees stay or leave!

417
00:20:49,700 --> 00:20:51,160
You have no right to drive them away!

418
00:20:51,160 --> 00:20:52,550
Cut the crap!

419
00:20:52,660 --> 00:20:53,640
This is an order
from the Department of Health

420
00:20:53,640 --> 00:20:54,770
of the City Hall!

421
00:20:56,480 --> 00:20:57,850
No doctor has even been here.

422
00:20:57,850 --> 00:20:58,460
How do you know

423
00:20:58,460 --> 00:20:59,860
they have tuberculosis?

424
00:20:59,980 --> 00:21:01,270
Are you two trying to be heroes

425
00:21:01,270 --> 00:21:01,770
or what?

426
00:21:02,200 --> 00:21:03,060
Take them away!

427
00:21:03,980 --> 00:21:04,790
What are you doing?

428
00:21:04,790 --> 00:21:05,850
What are you doing?

429
00:21:09,000 --> 00:21:09,930
What do you want?

430
00:21:10,380 --> 00:21:10,720
Freeze!

431
00:21:10,720 --> 00:21:11,720
Watch the kids!

432
00:21:14,460 --> 00:21:15,490
You can't do this!

433
00:21:32,520 --> 00:21:33,450
Army Commander.

434
00:21:33,810 --> 00:21:34,850
Rest assured, Army Commander.

435
00:21:34,850 --> 00:21:35,530
We will immediately

436
00:21:35,530 --> 00:21:36,660
clean up this place.

437
00:21:47,290 --> 00:21:48,350
What are you doing?

438
00:21:50,720 --> 00:21:51,650
Give me the kids.

439
00:21:51,750 --> 00:21:52,850
What are you going to do to them?

440
00:21:52,850 --> 00:21:54,430
Cut the crap. Hurry up.

441
00:22:05,960 --> 00:22:06,790
What are you doing, Ye Pingjun?

442
00:22:06,790 --> 00:22:07,590
Are you crazy?

443
00:22:08,380 --> 00:22:09,350
Yu Changxuan.

444
00:22:11,270 --> 00:22:13,130
You are extremely cold-blooded.

445
00:22:13,790 --> 00:22:14,920
You misunderstood.

446
00:22:15,320 --> 00:22:15,920
These soldiers are not

447
00:22:15,920 --> 00:22:17,110
our men at all.

448
00:22:19,270 --> 00:22:20,670
Who told you to come here?

449
00:22:21,840 --> 00:22:22,770
Director Liang.

450
00:22:22,980 --> 00:22:23,440
Miss Ye.

451
00:22:23,480 --> 00:22:24,810
It's indeed a misunderstanding.

452
00:22:24,810 --> 00:22:25,710
The Army Commander is here this time

453
00:22:25,710 --> 00:22:27,240
to distribute supplies,

454
00:22:27,510 --> 00:22:28,710
not to arrest people.

455
00:22:28,910 --> 00:22:30,010
He's not here to arrest us?

456
00:22:30,010 --> 00:22:31,140
That's great.

457
00:22:38,460 --> 00:22:39,270
It's true.

458
00:22:45,570 --> 00:22:46,460
Fifth Young Master Yu.

459
00:22:46,460 --> 00:22:47,310
Sorry, I...

460
00:22:48,050 --> 00:22:48,580
I...

461
00:23:04,570 --> 00:23:05,900
Lock down the camp immediately

462
00:23:05,900 --> 00:23:07,210
and disinfect everything!

463
00:23:07,210 --> 00:23:08,190
Everyone

464
00:23:08,520 --> 00:23:09,900
must be examined!

465
00:23:10,550 --> 00:23:11,550
The sick children

466
00:23:12,350 --> 00:23:14,290
must be sent
to Renxin Hospital immediately.

467
00:23:14,290 --> 00:23:14,720
Yes!

468
00:23:42,000 --> 00:23:42,720
These children

469
00:23:42,720 --> 00:23:44,610
have a cough caused by a lung infection.

470
00:23:44,610 --> 00:23:46,550
The symptoms are mild and not contagious.

471
00:23:46,550 --> 00:23:47,920
Good thing they were brought here in time.

472
00:23:47,920 --> 00:23:49,510
They will recover in a couple of days.

473
00:23:49,510 --> 00:23:51,310
That's good. Thank you, doctor.

474
00:23:51,590 --> 00:23:52,650
Thank you, doctor.

475
00:24:13,880 --> 00:24:14,510
Kid,

476
00:24:15,400 --> 00:24:16,610
why aren't you sleeping yet?

477
00:24:16,610 --> 00:24:17,220
Sir,

478
00:24:17,310 --> 00:24:19,090
when can we go home?

479
00:24:19,720 --> 00:24:20,650
When you recover

480
00:24:21,140 --> 00:24:21,510
and aren't

481
00:24:21,510 --> 00:24:22,810
contagious,

482
00:24:23,110 --> 00:24:23,980
you can go back.

483
00:24:28,940 --> 00:24:29,800
How about this?

484
00:24:31,640 --> 00:24:33,240
I'll teach you a little game.

485
00:24:34,000 --> 00:24:35,060
If you play it well,

486
00:24:35,380 --> 00:24:36,290
you have to go to sleep like good kids,

487
00:24:36,290 --> 00:24:37,010
okay?

488
00:24:37,550 --> 00:24:38,030
Okay.

489
00:24:42,180 --> 00:24:43,110
Look at the wall.

490
00:25:02,920 --> 00:25:03,720
Want to learn?

491
00:25:03,850 --> 00:25:04,710
I'll teach you.

492
00:25:04,980 --> 00:25:05,940
No, sir.

493
00:25:05,940 --> 00:25:07,380
I'll make you sick.

494
00:25:14,330 --> 00:25:16,060
I've already asked the doctor.

495
00:25:16,810 --> 00:25:18,270
You're not seriously ill.

496
00:25:18,740 --> 00:25:19,610
You just need to rest in the hospital

497
00:25:19,610 --> 00:25:20,770
for a few days.

498
00:25:21,310 --> 00:25:21,900
Really?

499
00:25:22,350 --> 00:25:23,090
Really?

500
00:25:25,670 --> 00:25:26,400
Pinky swear.

501
00:25:47,050 --> 00:25:47,530
Look.

502
00:25:48,740 --> 00:25:50,470
The little bird is flying home.

503
00:25:51,240 --> 00:25:51,900
Sir,

504
00:25:52,510 --> 00:25:55,350
can... the little bird

505
00:25:55,810 --> 00:25:56,440
take

506
00:25:56,830 --> 00:25:57,640
our secrets

507
00:25:57,640 --> 00:25:59,270
to our parents?

508
00:26:02,110 --> 00:26:03,170
It definitely can.

509
00:26:04,070 --> 00:26:05,660
It will deliver every word

510
00:26:06,510 --> 00:26:08,380
you want to say.

511
00:26:37,560 --> 00:26:41,630
[Ward 11]

512
00:26:46,090 --> 00:26:46,740
Sorry.

513
00:26:48,000 --> 00:26:49,730
I misunderstood you this time.

514
00:26:50,160 --> 00:26:51,220
No surprise there.

515
00:26:52,110 --> 00:26:53,710
After all, someone said I was

516
00:26:54,290 --> 00:26:55,750
cold-blooded, ruthless,

517
00:26:56,500 --> 00:26:57,790
and hopeless.

518
00:27:01,720 --> 00:27:02,740
Anyway,

519
00:27:04,240 --> 00:27:06,440
I thank you on behalf of these refugees.

520
00:27:07,220 --> 00:27:08,660
If they can stay,

521
00:27:09,270 --> 00:27:11,090
the people here will remember

522
00:27:11,090 --> 00:27:13,090
the great kindness of the Yu family.

523
00:27:17,000 --> 00:27:18,920
You're piling on the praise,

524
00:27:20,160 --> 00:27:22,220
making me out to be some kind of saint.

525
00:27:24,200 --> 00:27:25,460
It must be hard for you.

526
00:27:28,200 --> 00:27:29,730
Don't celebrate too early.

527
00:27:30,000 --> 00:27:31,600
We don't know the result yet.

528
00:27:33,160 --> 00:27:34,420
Fifth Young Master Yu.

529
00:27:42,530 --> 00:27:43,730
I read the newspaper.

530
00:27:44,270 --> 00:27:45,700
Congratulations to you
and Second Young Lady Tao

531
00:27:45,700 --> 00:27:47,140
on your upcoming wedding.

532
00:27:47,140 --> 00:27:48,940
You finally got what you wanted.

533
00:28:06,180 --> 00:28:06,940
So,

534
00:28:08,790 --> 00:28:10,030
now you're

535
00:28:10,050 --> 00:28:11,570
of no use to me anymore.

536
00:28:13,400 --> 00:28:15,160
You can no longer act

537
00:28:15,850 --> 00:28:17,710
so presumptuously in front of me.

538
00:28:18,290 --> 00:28:19,290
I'll remember

539
00:28:21,050 --> 00:28:21,750
this slap.

540
00:28:46,050 --> 00:28:46,710
Changxuan.

541
00:28:49,900 --> 00:28:50,560
I found out.

542
00:28:50,960 --> 00:28:51,660
Those soldiers belong to

543
00:28:51,660 --> 00:28:52,720
the 27th Regiment.

544
00:28:52,940 --> 00:28:54,250
Commander Huang Dakui saw

545
00:28:54,250 --> 00:28:55,680
that we'd been
investigating brothels lately.

546
00:28:55,680 --> 00:28:56,440
He was afraid

547
00:28:56,440 --> 00:28:57,960
his red-light district would be in danger.

548
00:28:57,960 --> 00:28:58,920
The refugee camp site

549
00:28:58,920 --> 00:29:00,520
is the new location he found.

550
00:29:01,850 --> 00:29:02,680
Huang Dakui?

551
00:29:05,140 --> 00:29:06,940
He is Feng Sanli's subordinate.

552
00:29:07,400 --> 00:29:07,750
Yes.

553
00:29:08,420 --> 00:29:10,820
Here are the testimonies of the witnesses.

554
00:29:12,590 --> 00:29:14,290
[Nanhuai Army Headquarters Exclusively]
[Huang Dakui's Testimony]

555
00:29:18,810 --> 00:29:19,480
When I announced

556
00:29:19,480 --> 00:29:20,830
the exam subjects,

557
00:29:21,460 --> 00:29:22,640
I told you all

558
00:29:23,500 --> 00:29:24,430
that any officer

559
00:29:24,640 --> 00:29:26,270
at the rank of company commander or above

560
00:29:26,270 --> 00:29:27,640
who failed the exam

561
00:29:28,550 --> 00:29:29,200
would be

562
00:29:29,440 --> 00:29:30,530
dismissed.

563
00:29:31,240 --> 00:29:31,810
Here

564
00:29:32,510 --> 00:29:34,700
is the list of officers being dismissed.

565
00:29:34,700 --> 00:29:35,380
Those named

566
00:29:36,010 --> 00:29:37,210
should step forward.

567
00:29:40,030 --> 00:29:43,670
[Exam Results List]

568
00:29:40,250 --> 00:29:41,000
Ma Jiu,

569
00:29:41,530 --> 00:29:44,050
Company Commander
of the Second Company, First Battalion.

570
00:29:44,050 --> 00:29:44,580
Present!

571
00:29:45,770 --> 00:29:48,770
Song Changchun,
Platoon Leader of the Third Platoon.

572
00:29:48,900 --> 00:29:49,430
Present!

573
00:29:49,640 --> 00:29:52,740
Cai Chenglian, Company Commander
of the Fifth Company.

574
00:29:52,740 --> 00:29:53,270
Present!

575
00:29:59,960 --> 00:30:01,240
And the last one,

576
00:30:01,790 --> 00:30:03,880
who scored the lowest in this exam,

577
00:30:04,510 --> 00:30:05,500
is Feng Sanli,

578
00:30:06,500 --> 00:30:07,290
Commander

579
00:30:08,200 --> 00:30:09,460
of the Fourth Brigade,

580
00:30:09,980 --> 00:30:11,250
Second Army

581
00:30:12,200 --> 00:30:13,250
of the Yu Army!

582
00:30:13,630 --> 00:30:15,420
How could Brigade Commander Feng...

583
00:30:15,420 --> 00:30:16,220
Yu Changxuan!

584
00:30:18,460 --> 00:30:19,390
Are you serious?

585
00:30:21,310 --> 00:30:23,070
The rules were announced long ago.

586
00:30:23,070 --> 00:30:24,930
If anyone has a problem with them,

587
00:30:25,030 --> 00:30:26,010
hit the books

588
00:30:26,990 --> 00:30:28,590
and earn your position back.

589
00:30:30,460 --> 00:30:31,160
Who dares?

590
00:30:31,850 --> 00:30:32,650
Yu Changxuan,

591
00:30:32,980 --> 00:30:34,850
you're still a junior to me.

592
00:30:35,050 --> 00:30:36,920
Those brats you've brought in

593
00:30:37,240 --> 00:30:39,640
would piss themselves on the battlefield.

594
00:30:39,770 --> 00:30:40,880
Teach me to study?

595
00:30:41,500 --> 00:30:43,760
Why shouldn't I be the one teaching them?

596
00:30:48,590 --> 00:30:51,390
Although you were dismissed
for failing the exam,

597
00:30:51,940 --> 00:30:54,070
you can still earn your position back.

598
00:30:54,640 --> 00:30:56,270
But openly defying

599
00:30:57,140 --> 00:30:58,420
a military order

600
00:30:59,640 --> 00:31:00,970
will never be tolerated

601
00:31:01,680 --> 00:31:02,530
in the Yu Army.

602
00:31:12,310 --> 00:31:13,810
What can you do to me?

603
00:31:14,640 --> 00:31:16,840
Fifty strokes with the military baton.

604
00:31:16,940 --> 00:31:18,070
Carry it out at once.

605
00:31:18,720 --> 00:31:19,070
Yes!

606
00:31:19,530 --> 00:31:20,720
Who dares!

607
00:31:24,330 --> 00:31:25,730
Brigade Commander Feng!

608
00:31:26,110 --> 00:31:27,440
Have you lost your mind?

609
00:31:27,500 --> 00:31:28,850
How dare you draw a gun
in front of the Army Commander?

610
00:31:28,850 --> 00:31:29,660
Put it down!

611
00:31:33,610 --> 00:31:35,300
I don't care.

612
00:31:35,530 --> 00:31:37,510
Anyone who tries to strip me of my uniform

613
00:31:37,510 --> 00:31:38,640
will pay in blood!

614
00:31:38,870 --> 00:31:40,140
I'll show him what real guns

615
00:31:40,140 --> 00:31:41,550
and bullets feel like!

616
00:32:06,010 --> 00:32:07,270
If you've got the guts,

617
00:32:08,110 --> 00:32:09,430
shoot me.

618
00:32:09,770 --> 00:32:10,570
Yu Changxuan.

619
00:32:11,070 --> 00:32:12,330
Don't push me!

620
00:32:12,980 --> 00:32:14,180
I'll shoot anyone

621
00:32:14,790 --> 00:32:16,010
who stops me!

622
00:32:35,070 --> 00:32:35,940
Feng Sanli.

623
00:32:36,880 --> 00:32:38,050
By rights I should shoot you

624
00:32:38,050 --> 00:32:38,900
on the spot.

625
00:32:41,000 --> 00:32:43,200
But considering your military merits,

626
00:32:43,440 --> 00:32:45,100
I'll put these three shots...

627
00:32:46,030 --> 00:32:47,920
on your tab for now.

628
00:32:48,740 --> 00:32:50,400
The next time you act up,

629
00:32:51,010 --> 00:32:52,220
you'll get them.

630
00:32:53,220 --> 00:32:54,590
Fifty strokes with the military baton!

631
00:32:54,590 --> 00:32:55,720
Carry it out at once!

632
00:32:56,010 --> 00:32:56,590
Yes!

633
00:33:06,810 --> 00:33:07,550
Take him away!

634
00:33:07,550 --> 00:33:08,210
-Yes.
-Yes.

635
00:33:26,140 --> 00:33:26,670
You brat!

636
00:33:30,200 --> 00:33:31,400
Why are you standing?

637
00:33:31,420 --> 00:33:32,180
Have a seat.

638
00:33:32,880 --> 00:33:34,110
How can I sit?

639
00:33:35,380 --> 00:33:36,250
What's wrong?

640
00:33:38,880 --> 00:33:39,540
Commander,

641
00:33:40,810 --> 00:33:42,880
is Fifth Young Master Yu
implementing reforms?

642
00:33:42,880 --> 00:33:44,920
He's trying to get us
all kicked out of our positions!

643
00:33:44,920 --> 00:33:46,050
Let me ask you something.

644
00:33:46,050 --> 00:33:47,110
Am I one of your men?

645
00:33:47,200 --> 00:33:47,740
Yes.

646
00:33:48,310 --> 00:33:49,570
Am I considered a veteran

647
00:33:49,570 --> 00:33:50,810
in the Yu Army?

648
00:33:51,380 --> 00:33:51,980
Of course.

649
00:33:52,510 --> 00:33:53,960
He had a few brats

650
00:33:54,680 --> 00:33:55,850
teach me how to read.

651
00:33:56,160 --> 00:33:57,330
And in front of my own men, he had me

652
00:33:57,330 --> 00:33:59,460
beaten with a military baton 50 times!

653
00:34:00,750 --> 00:34:01,350
Let me see.

654
00:34:01,420 --> 00:34:02,280
Don't touch it!

655
00:34:03,180 --> 00:34:03,790
It hurts.

656
00:34:07,740 --> 00:34:09,420
He gave you 50 strokes?

657
00:34:10,050 --> 00:34:10,780
Yes.

658
00:34:12,090 --> 00:34:13,380
So what did you do?

659
00:34:13,760 --> 00:34:15,989
I... I did nothing.

660
00:34:17,030 --> 00:34:18,380
You did nothing?

661
00:34:19,659 --> 00:34:20,989
You think

662
00:34:22,130 --> 00:34:23,710
I've been resting at home

663
00:34:24,880 --> 00:34:26,860
and have no idea what's going on outside,

664
00:34:26,860 --> 00:34:27,500
don't you?

665
00:34:28,110 --> 00:34:31,940
You think I don't know

666
00:34:32,110 --> 00:34:33,280
what you've done,

667
00:34:33,420 --> 00:34:34,210
right?

668
00:34:34,670 --> 00:34:35,150
I...

669
00:34:38,530 --> 00:34:39,340
Commander.

670
00:34:40,670 --> 00:34:41,730
I just did some...

671
00:34:41,730 --> 00:34:43,150
ordinary business.

672
00:34:43,480 --> 00:34:44,610
Ordinary business?

673
00:34:45,380 --> 00:34:45,980
Right.

674
00:34:46,150 --> 00:34:48,820
You dare say it's not dirty business?

675
00:34:52,840 --> 00:34:53,420
No.

676
00:34:53,710 --> 00:34:54,670
Feng Sanli.

677
00:34:56,010 --> 00:34:58,210
You keep saying you're my man

678
00:34:58,210 --> 00:34:59,820
and a veteran,

679
00:35:00,400 --> 00:35:02,380
but you've embarrassed me!

680
00:35:10,780 --> 00:35:11,340
Enough.

681
00:35:13,230 --> 00:35:15,030
Go back and reflect on yourself.

682
00:35:15,050 --> 00:35:16,150
I'll handle

683
00:35:17,400 --> 00:35:18,500
the rest.

684
00:35:21,550 --> 00:35:22,150
Yes.

685
00:35:24,730 --> 00:35:25,940
Do you know

686
00:35:26,150 --> 00:35:27,640
how many people have come to me

687
00:35:27,640 --> 00:35:29,300
to complain about you lately?

688
00:35:29,530 --> 00:35:31,150
My rosewood threshold

689
00:35:31,150 --> 00:35:32,280
is worn down.

690
00:35:32,670 --> 00:35:33,460
You taught me

691
00:35:34,170 --> 00:35:35,710
to use both kindness and severity.

692
00:35:35,710 --> 00:35:37,110
Without ruthless methods,

693
00:35:37,110 --> 00:35:38,970
how can one have a merciful heart?

694
00:35:41,230 --> 00:35:42,570
Every level of the army

695
00:35:42,820 --> 00:35:44,940
is interconnected.

696
00:35:45,360 --> 00:35:46,560
It's not that simple.

697
00:35:47,690 --> 00:35:48,780
These problems

698
00:35:49,300 --> 00:35:51,160
can only be dealt with gradually.

699
00:35:51,480 --> 00:35:53,480
You can't just use strong medicine.

700
00:35:54,150 --> 00:35:56,690
You believe in taking a gradual approach,

701
00:35:57,280 --> 00:35:58,480
using mild remedies.

702
00:35:59,210 --> 00:36:00,550
But I think

703
00:36:00,840 --> 00:36:02,480
once a tumor is found,

704
00:36:02,690 --> 00:36:03,900
it must be removed surgically

705
00:36:03,900 --> 00:36:04,730
right away.

706
00:36:05,320 --> 00:36:05,980
Otherwise,

707
00:36:06,670 --> 00:36:08,900
by the time the disease reaches
its terminal stage,

708
00:36:08,900 --> 00:36:10,360
it may be too late to treat.

709
00:36:12,000 --> 00:36:13,370
You dismissed so many officers

710
00:36:13,370 --> 00:36:15,050
to make an example of them.

711
00:36:16,590 --> 00:36:19,320
Who will fill all those vacant positions?

712
00:36:19,920 --> 00:36:21,570
The people I want to replace them with

713
00:36:21,570 --> 00:36:23,030
are trained in modern firearms

714
00:36:23,030 --> 00:36:24,780
and military deployment.

715
00:36:24,860 --> 00:36:26,630
Putting them in these positions

716
00:36:26,630 --> 00:36:28,610
is the real reform of the Yu Army.

717
00:36:30,820 --> 00:36:33,220
You've already got replacements lined up?

718
00:36:34,210 --> 00:36:35,340
Looks like

719
00:36:35,340 --> 00:36:37,470
you've been planning this for a while.

720
00:36:38,480 --> 00:36:39,590
Where did you

721
00:36:40,650 --> 00:36:42,420
find these men?

722
00:36:42,880 --> 00:36:44,210
The Cheng Army POW camp.

723
00:36:51,670 --> 00:36:53,930
Marshal Xu captured a group of officers.

724
00:36:54,000 --> 00:36:55,730
They were all formally trained

725
00:36:55,860 --> 00:36:57,380
at Japanese military academies.

726
00:36:57,380 --> 00:36:59,030
The real reform in the Yu Army

727
00:36:59,820 --> 00:37:01,550
has to start with talent.

728
00:37:05,570 --> 00:37:06,170
East Wind.

729
00:37:14,260 --> 00:37:15,030
North Wind.

730
00:37:16,570 --> 00:37:17,190
Sister.

731
00:37:17,670 --> 00:37:18,530
One Character.

732
00:37:19,420 --> 00:37:19,960
Pong.

733
00:37:28,050 --> 00:37:29,110
Three Characters.

734
00:37:36,530 --> 00:37:37,150
Mahjong.

735
00:37:37,340 --> 00:37:38,070
Let me check.

736
00:37:39,510 --> 00:37:40,480
You really did win.

737
00:37:40,480 --> 00:37:41,360
And it's a flush.

738
00:37:41,360 --> 00:37:42,090
You won again.

739
00:37:42,090 --> 00:37:42,840
Mahjong.

740
00:37:43,010 --> 00:37:43,360
Let me check.

741
00:37:43,360 --> 00:37:44,460
Such a big hand.

742
00:37:44,980 --> 00:37:45,830
Pay up, pay up.

743
00:37:45,920 --> 00:37:48,240
You're so lucky.

744
00:37:48,610 --> 00:37:49,530
Baoru.

745
00:37:50,110 --> 00:37:51,000
Lately,

746
00:37:51,280 --> 00:37:52,090
not getting into trouble

747
00:37:52,090 --> 00:37:53,570
is already a blessing.

748
00:37:54,900 --> 00:37:56,860
With Fifth Young Master Yu's
military reform,

749
00:37:56,860 --> 00:37:57,710
my husband

750
00:37:57,710 --> 00:37:59,900
has become a prime target for suppression.

751
00:37:59,900 --> 00:38:00,960
I really don't know

752
00:38:01,050 --> 00:38:03,360
how much longer he can wear that uniform.

753
00:38:04,650 --> 00:38:06,500
Don't say that.

754
00:38:07,690 --> 00:38:10,730
You held Changxuan when he was born.

755
00:38:10,880 --> 00:38:11,880
Our bond

756
00:38:11,880 --> 00:38:13,440
is not an ordinary one.

757
00:38:15,460 --> 00:38:17,400
For Changxuan's military reform,

758
00:38:17,630 --> 00:38:19,000
he needs

759
00:38:19,000 --> 00:38:20,460
his uncles' cooperation.

760
00:38:22,110 --> 00:38:25,440
Fifth Young Master
is really being harsh this time.

761
00:38:25,840 --> 00:38:27,090
Everyone at this mahjong table

762
00:38:27,090 --> 00:38:28,320
is family.

763
00:38:30,630 --> 00:38:32,290
Hurry, set up the tiles.

764
00:38:32,320 --> 00:38:33,480
I can't even keep up.

765
00:38:36,230 --> 00:38:36,830
West Wind.

766
00:38:40,110 --> 00:38:40,860
Four Dots.

767
00:38:42,210 --> 00:38:42,980
Mahjong!

768
00:38:44,860 --> 00:38:45,630
Again?

769
00:38:47,400 --> 00:38:49,230
Baoru is so good to me.

770
00:38:49,550 --> 00:38:51,480
Your luck is unstoppable.

771
00:38:52,820 --> 00:38:53,780
I'm so happy.

772
00:38:53,780 --> 00:38:54,840
Today is a good day.

773
00:39:00,590 --> 00:39:04,960
[Chunfeng Troupe Charity Performance]

774
00:39:02,710 --> 00:39:05,110
Little birthday girl, here comes the cake!

775
00:39:07,650 --> 00:39:08,710
Light the candles.

776
00:39:11,030 --> 00:39:13,010
Happy birthday, baby.

777
00:39:13,960 --> 00:39:14,960
Thank you, Dad.

778
00:39:15,170 --> 00:39:16,030
Thank you, Mom.

779
00:39:16,320 --> 00:39:17,630
Okay, blow out the candles.

780
00:39:17,630 --> 00:39:20,650
Sweetheart, today is your birthday.

781
00:39:21,210 --> 00:39:23,860
Mom and Dad wish you a happy birthday.

782
00:39:24,030 --> 00:39:25,690
Dad, Mom.

783
00:39:26,070 --> 00:39:28,230
I'm not hungry. You drink it.

784
00:39:28,340 --> 00:39:28,820
Drink it.

785
00:39:28,820 --> 00:39:29,810
You drink it.

786
00:39:29,980 --> 00:39:31,460
Be good. Drink it.

787
00:39:34,090 --> 00:39:36,460
Oh no! Hurry!

788
00:39:38,090 --> 00:39:38,550
Come on!

789
00:39:39,010 --> 00:39:39,610
Have a bite

790
00:39:39,760 --> 00:39:41,500
of the longevity noodles Dad made for you.

791
00:39:41,500 --> 00:39:42,420
Don't be afraid.

792
00:39:42,420 --> 00:39:43,350
Don't be afraid!

793
00:39:43,590 --> 00:39:44,210
Don't be afraid!

794
00:39:44,210 --> 00:39:45,140
Don't be afraid!

795
00:39:50,320 --> 00:39:51,570
Time for fireworks!

796
00:39:56,920 --> 00:39:58,860
Another explosion!

797
00:39:58,940 --> 00:40:00,480
Dad, Mom.

798
00:40:00,480 --> 00:40:01,900
I'm so scared!

799
00:40:02,590 --> 00:40:03,520
Don't be afraid.

800
00:40:04,030 --> 00:40:05,890
Just pretend they are fireworks.

801
00:40:06,300 --> 00:40:06,860
Look!

802
00:40:07,320 --> 00:40:09,840
How bright the fireworks in the sky are!

803
00:40:17,480 --> 00:40:20,070
Dad! Mom!

804
00:40:20,420 --> 00:40:23,320
Mom, wake up!

805
00:40:23,530 --> 00:40:26,610
Dad, wake up!

806
00:40:26,860 --> 00:40:29,070
Dad!

807
00:40:29,360 --> 00:40:30,840
Mom!

808
00:40:30,980 --> 00:40:33,070
Wake up!

809
00:40:32,200 --> 00:40:35,950
[Chunfeng Troupe Charity Performance]

810
00:40:33,300 --> 00:40:34,480
Mom!

811
00:40:41,260 --> 00:40:43,030
I'm growing up.

812
00:40:43,460 --> 00:40:44,510
Congratulations,

813
00:40:44,510 --> 00:40:45,110
daughter.

814
00:40:45,400 --> 00:40:47,710
You've wanted to be a journalist
since you were little,

815
00:40:47,710 --> 00:40:49,630
and now your dream has come true.

816
00:40:51,300 --> 00:40:52,780
I love journalism.

817
00:40:53,010 --> 00:40:54,320
I want to bring more people

818
00:40:54,320 --> 00:40:55,650
to see a bigger world.

819
00:40:57,590 --> 00:40:58,450
What about you?

820
00:41:04,190 --> 00:41:06,380
What do you want to be when you grow up?

821
00:41:11,130 --> 00:41:12,390
After all these years,

822
00:41:12,840 --> 00:41:14,300
why haven't you grown up?

823
00:41:20,690 --> 00:41:23,920
Because I will never grow up.

824
00:41:40,090 --> 00:41:41,730
None of what you see today

825
00:41:42,010 --> 00:41:43,280
is fiction.

826
00:41:44,110 --> 00:41:46,040
In the refugee camp in the suburbs,

827
00:41:46,150 --> 00:41:47,400
people suffer

828
00:41:48,150 --> 00:41:50,650
from hunger and cold every day,

829
00:41:51,630 --> 00:41:54,160
as well as the pain
of losing their loved ones.

830
00:41:54,480 --> 00:41:56,920
If war is inevitable,

831
00:41:57,900 --> 00:41:59,800
I implore everyone

832
00:42:00,260 --> 00:42:00,960
to lend them

833
00:42:00,960 --> 00:42:02,360
a helping hand.

834
00:42:02,960 --> 00:42:04,960
This way, they can at least

835
00:42:05,460 --> 00:42:07,260
have a place to stay in Nanhuai

836
00:42:09,820 --> 00:42:10,460
and a chance

837
00:42:10,460 --> 00:42:11,780
to survive.

838
00:42:12,840 --> 00:42:13,510
Let's help

839
00:42:13,510 --> 00:42:15,370
our suffering fellow countrymen

840
00:42:16,210 --> 00:42:17,610
feel warmth

841
00:42:18,900 --> 00:42:19,840
once again.

842
00:42:21,360 --> 00:42:22,620
We humbly ask everyone

843
00:42:23,170 --> 00:42:24,820
to show compassion for the victims

844
00:42:24,820 --> 00:42:26,080
and offer them relief.

845
00:42:26,340 --> 00:42:27,940
The entire Chunfeng Troupe

846
00:42:29,800 --> 00:42:30,610
would be deeply grateful.

847
00:42:30,580 --> 00:42:34,600
[Chunfeng Troupe Charity Performance]

848
00:42:45,470 --> 00:42:48,100
[Chunfeng Troupe Charity Performance]

849
00:43:08,300 --> 00:43:08,840
Bravo!

850
00:43:09,170 --> 00:43:09,820
Bravo!

851
00:43:09,860 --> 00:43:11,320
Bravo! Bravo! Bravo!

852
00:43:11,500 --> 00:43:14,190
Bravo! Bravo! Bravo!

853
00:43:14,980 --> 00:43:15,460
Bravo!

854
00:43:24,650 --> 00:43:25,340
Miss,

855
00:43:25,550 --> 00:43:27,340
a gentleman gave this to you.
